{
  "name": "Lead intake — gasandoilrecruitment.com",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (5 minutes)\n\n1. **Credentials**: attach your Google Sheets OAuth2 credential to *Append lead row*, and your Gmail OAuth2 credential to *Email owner alert*.\n2. **Environment variables** on the n8n host:\n   - `GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID` — e.g. `G-XXXXXXXXXX`\n   - `GA4_API_SECRET` — GA4 → Admin → Data streams → Measurement Protocol API secrets\n   - `OWNER_ALERT_EMAIL` — where lead alerts go\n3. In *Append lead row*, pick the lead-log Google Sheet and the `Leads` tab (create the header row first — see README).\n4. **Activate** the workflow, copy the production webhook URL, and set it as the Worker's secret:\n   `npx wrangler secret put N8N_WEBHOOK_URL`\n\nThe GA4 node is set to continue-on-fail: an analytics hiccup never loses a lead.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "note-setup",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-240, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "gasandoilrecruitment-lead",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-receive",
      "name": "Receive lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-240, 380],
      "webhookId": "gasandoilrecruitment-lead"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normalise the Worker envelope into flat fields for the Sheet/GA4/email nodes.\nconst lead = $json.body ?? $json;\nconst f = lead.fields || {};\n\n// GA4 Measurement Protocol needs a client_id; derive a stable one from email+site.\nlet h = 0;\nconst s = (f.email || \"anonymous\") + (lead.site || \"\");\nfor (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) h = (h * 31 + s.charCodeAt(i)) >>> 0;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    receivedAt: lead.receivedAt || new Date().toISOString(),\n    site: lead.site || \"\",\n    form: lead.form || \"\",\n    name: f.name || \"\",\n    email: f.email || \"\",\n    phone: f.phone || \"\",\n    role: f.role || f.discipline || f.topic || \"\",\n    message: f.message || \"\",\n    cv: f.cv || \"\",\n    page: lead.page || \"\",\n    ip: lead.ip || \"\",\n    country: lead.country || \"\",\n    userAgent: lead.userAgent || \"\",\n    clientId: String(h || 1)\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-normalize",
      "name": "Normalise lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheetWithinDocument",
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PASTE_LEAD_LOG_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Leads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Received At": "={{ $json.receivedAt }}",
            "Site": "={{ $json.site }}",
            "Form": "={{ $json.form }}",
            "Name": "={{ $json.name }}",
            "Email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "Phone": "={{ $json.phone }}",
            "Role / Interest": "={{ $json.role }}",
            "Message": "={{ $json.message }}",
            "CV": "={{ $json.cv }}",
            "Page": "={{ $json.page }}",
            "IP": "={{ $json.ip }}",
            "Country": "={{ $json.country }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            { "id": "Received At", "displayName": "Received At", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Site", "displayName": "Site", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Form", "displayName": "Form", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Name", "displayName": "Name", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Email", "displayName": "Email", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Phone", "displayName": "Phone", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Role / Interest", "displayName": "Role / Interest", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Message", "displayName": "Message", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "CV", "displayName": "CV", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Page", "displayName": "Page", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "IP", "displayName": "IP", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true },
            { "id": "Country", "displayName": "Country", "required": false, "defaultMatch": false, "display": true, "type": "string", "canBeUsedToMatch": true }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-append",
      "name": "Append lead row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [240, 380],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://www.google-analytics.com/mp/collect",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "measurement_id", "value": "={{ $env.GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID }}" },
            { "name": "api_secret", "value": "={{ $env.GA4_API_SECRET }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"client_id\": \"{{ $json.clientId }}\",\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"lead_received\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"site\": \"{{ $json.site }}\",\n        \"form_name\": \"{{ $json.form }}\",\n        \"role\": \"{{ $json.role }}\",\n        \"page_location\": \"{{ $json.page }}\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ga4-event",
      "name": "Fire GA4 event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [480, 380],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $env.OWNER_ALERT_EMAIL }}",
        "subject": "=New lead — {{ $json.form }} — {{ $json.name }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=New {{ $json.form }} lead on {{ $json.site }}\n\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.email }}\nPhone: {{ $json.phone }}\nRole / interest: {{ $json.role }}\nCV: {{ $json.cv || '—' }}\n\nMessage:\n{{ $json.message || '—' }}\n\nPage: {{ $json.page }}\nReceived: {{ $json.receivedAt }}\nIP: {{ $json.ip }} ({{ $json.country }})",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gmail-alert",
      "name": "Email owner alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [720, 380],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gmail account (owner alerts)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={ \"ok\": true }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-ok",
      "name": "Respond OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [960, 380]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Receive lead": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Normalise lead", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Normalise lead": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Append lead row", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Append lead row": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Fire GA4 event", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Fire GA4 event": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Email owner alert", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Email owner alert": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond OK", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "staticData": null,
  "pinData": {}
}
